The simulator appeared in xtc 1.0.
The header was installed, and
.Fn xtc_sim_active ,
.Fn xtc_sim_rand ,
.Fn xtc_sim_fd_ready_at ,
.Fn xtc_sim_external_begin ,
.Fn xtc_sim_external_complete
and the public
.Fn XTC_DST_BUG
were added, in xtc 2.2.
